{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38087","headline":"八月六日作四首 二 · 韩偓","name":"八月六日作四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金虎挻灾不复论，构成狂猘犯车尘。\n御衣空惜侍中血，国玺几危皇后身。\n图霸未能知盗道，饰非唯欲害仁人。\n黄旗紫气今仍旧，免使老臣攀画轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}